<title>USA: Serengeti Eyewear buys Corning unit.</title>
<headline>Serengeti Eyewear buys Corning unit.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serengeti Eyewear Inc, formerly known as Solar-Mates Inc, said Friday it has acquired the Serengeti eyewear business from Corning Inc for $27.5 million.</p>
<p>Serengeti Eyewear Inc said the acquisition would give it extensive distribution in the premium eyewear market.</p>
